  "title": "Image of a helicopter in the distance as it prepares to land, with individuals wearing protective gear (vests and hard hats) await its arrival.",
  "summary": "As winter loosens its grip across our Canadian timberlands, another season quickly comes into focus — wildfire season — and spring offers a critical window to transition and prepare for drier conditions. Across regions, our teams update plans, test equipment, refresh training and reconnect with partners. The goal is simple: be ready to act before the first spark.",
